---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ExternalLink from '@/components/base/ExternalLink.astro';

const pageTitle = `Now`;

const lastTended = '2026-10-23';

const lastTendedDisplay = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB', {
    day: 'numeric',
    month: 'long',
    year: 'numeric',
    timeZone: 'UTC',
}).format(new Date(lastTended));
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
    <article class="prose flow">
        <p>
            What I have been up to as of late. This is a /now page, which you can learn more about
            at <ExternalLink href="https://nownownow.com/about" label="nownownow.com" />.
        </p>

        <p class="last">
            Last tended to: <time datetime={lastTended}>{lastTendedDisplay}</time>
        </p>

        <hr />
        <h2><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span> Working on</h2>

        <p>
            This is my second build of an Astro project. Currently trying to make smarter choices
            for future iterations. I'm also having fun with the ListenBrainz API. We'll see where
            that takes me.
        </p>

        <h2><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span> Thinking about</h2>

        <p>
            How to manage my time as my health has changed once again. I'm already very selective
            about my attention and energy — how can I improve my overall joy despite failing in
            certain aspects?
        </p>

        <h2><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span> Personal</h2>
        <p>
            Dealing with a large number of related and unrelated physical problems. I'm going to be
            having tests done and more blood drawn. I'm eyeing long COVID once again, but it could
            be a million things.
        </p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
    .last {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-family: var(--font-family--mono);
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }

    h2 {
        line-height: 1;
        font-size: var(--text-base);
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-family: var(--font-family--mono);
    }
    h2 span {
        font-size: var(--text-xl);
        line-height: 0;
        margin-inline-end: var(--space-4px);
    }
</style>
